# ── NDA: corpus-derived content ─────────────────────────────
# Generated questions are derived from the client corpus and must not
# reach the personal `origin` remote. Both remotes share a branch, so a
# push sends every commit on it — the only safe control is to keep this
# content out of the branch entirely. Deliver it to EdGenAI by email or
# through a branch pushed solely to `industry`.
outputs/question_corpus.json
outputs/question_corpus.xlsx
docs/human_evaluation_ROUND1.xlsx
